WEBVTT

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:31.684
Jadikan yang terbaik

00:10:31.708 --> 00:10:36.708
Ku tahu, semua ku tahu,
semua ku tahu

00:10:37.708 --> 00:10:43.351
Ku tahu, semua ku tahu,
semua ku tahu

00:10:43.375 --> 00:10:46.143
Kini gerakkan pinggulmu

00:10:46.167 --> 00:10:49.351
Kini tersenyumlah

00:10:49.375 --> 00:10:52.101
Gerakkan pinggulmu lebih kencang

00:10:52.125 --> 00:10:55.268
Bersemangatlah

00:10:55.292 --> 00:10:58.309
Na wale wako fifty fifty comsi

00:10:58.333 --> 00:11:01.101
Na wale wako fiti pia sisi